{"full":"hf:MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith","spaceId":"MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith","name":"GameSmith AI","source":"huggingface","description":"AI-powered 2D sprite generator & animator with Gemini","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","building-mcp-track-creative","mcp-in-action-track-creative","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":20,"created":"2025-11-30T20:11:13.000Z","updated":"2025-11-30T23:59:20.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://mcp-1st-birthday-gamesmith.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.325Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.325Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.325Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎮","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GameSmith AI is a dual-interface Game Asset Generator that functions as both a human-friendly Web App and an AI-accessible MCP Server.","It solves the biggest bottleneck in indie game development: Creating consistent, animated assets in any 2D art style.","By leveraging Google Gemini 2.5 Flash for style-consistent character generation and Google Veo for physics-aware animation, GameSmith allows developers (and AI agents!) to go from a text prompt to a ready-to-use sprite sheet in seconds. Supports pixel art, anime, cartoon, vector, and more."],"features":["Text-to-Character Generation: Creates high-quality, flat 2D game characters (sprites) in any art style (pixel art, anime, cartoon, vector, etc.) using advanced prompting strategies to ensure game-ready assets.","AI Animation (Veo): Uses Google's Veo model to generate fluid animations (Idle, Walk, Run, Jump) that preserve the original art style of the input character.","Asset Extraction: Automatically converts the generated video animations into standard sprite sheet frames (PNGs) and ZIP archives, ready for engines like Unity, Godot, or Phaser.","MCP Native: All functionality is exposed via the Model Context Protocol. You can ask Claude: \"Make a cute cat character, animate it walking, and give me the frames\" and it will execute the entire pipeline autonomously."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9f9f5a1705fa86207a22ecde8ec6393798689c25d2f3da3ed29575dd11ad4620","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.408Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.408Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GameSmith AI is a dual-interface Game Asset Generator that functions as both a human-friendly Web App and an AI-accessible MCP Server.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"By leveraging Google Gemini 2.5 Flash for style-consistent character generation and Google Veo for physics-aware animation, GameSmith allows developers (and AI agents!) to go from a text prompt to a ready-to-use sprite sheet in seconds. Supports pixel art, anime, cartoon, vector, and more.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9f9f5a1705fa86207a22ecde8ec6393798689c25d2f3da3ed29575dd11ad4620","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.408Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-11-30T23:59:20.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MCP-1st-Birthday/GameSmith/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:28:07.408Z","hash":"9f9f5a1705fa86207a22ecde8ec6393798689c25d2f3da3ed29575dd11ad4620","originalBytes":8223,"storedBytes":8223,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["mcp","gamesmith","character","sprite","claude","game","add","json","mcp-remote","npx","server","transport","args","art","code","command","gemini","generate","mcpservers","pixel","sse-only","tools","animation","bash","client","frames","goo